SUMMARY:World Movie Night: Sentimental Value
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our first World Movie Night this summer! Watching 
 and reading your way around the world as part of our World Championship 
 Challenge? Consider this a worthy Group E pick -- come to our screening\, 
 and let us know how it stacks up in your tournament bracket. 
 \n\nSENTIMENTAL VALUE (2025)\ndirected by Joachim Trier (Norway)\nR\, 2h 
 13min\n\nAn intimate exploration of family\, memories\, and the 
 reconciliatory power of art. **2025 Academy Award Winner for Best 
 International Feature Film** Nominated for 9 Academy Awards\, including 
 Best Picture\, Best Director\, Best Original Screenplay\, Best Editing\, 
 and the performances of all 4 leads--Renate Reinsve\, Stellan Skarsgård\, 
 Inga Ibsdotter Illeas\, and Elle Fanning.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 2\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Movie
