SUMMARY:Classical Guitar Recital with Carlos Pavan
DESCRIPTION:With Carlos Pavan\n\nAn Argentine composer and guitarist based 
 in Brooklyn\, he combines elements of current jazz and classical music with 
 traditional Argentine tango and folklore. His famed concert presentations 
 typically revolve around his original Suite Ficciones\, which is a suite in 
 the classical manner that was directly inspired by short stories written by 
 Jorge Luis Borges\, a renowned author from Argentina.\n\nArtist 
 Information\n\nHe received instruction from maestros Jorge Morel\, Dave 
 Smey (Brooklyn Conservatory)\, and Pablo Ziegler (pianist for A. 
 Piazzolla). Carlos has produced four recordings featuring his 
 compositions\, which encompass a string quartet\, chamber ensemble\, and 
 trio concertante.\n\n \n\nThis event will be held in the community room 1
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
